anced. Consider hiring or reassigning team members to manage workload effectively.\n\n## General Recommendations\n- **Process Improvement**: Implement regular retrospectives to identify inefficiencies and areas for improvement.\n- **Resource Management**: Optimize resource allocation based on priority and urgency to improve resolution times and reduce backlog.\n- **Data Collection**: Enhance data collection on velocity and sprint performance for more comprehensive analysis and decision-making."
